{"speciesId":404,"names":{"fr":"Luxio","es":"Luxio","en":"Luxio","ja":"ルクシオ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its claws loose electricity with enough amperage to cause fainting. They live in small groups."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It rests its forelegs on others to communicate with rhythmic electric pulses from its claws."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"By gathering their tails together, they collectively generate powerful electricity from their claws."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"By gathering their tails together, they collectively generate powerful electricity from their claws."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Le courant qui circule à la pointe de ses griffes est capable de faire perdre connaissance à ses proies."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Le courant qui circule à la pointe de ses griffes est capable de faire perdre connaissance à ses proies."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"L’électricité libérée par ses griffes peut assommer l’ennemi. Il vit en petits groupes."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Sus garras emiten electricidad que puede debilitar a sus rivales. Viven en grupos pequeños."},{"lang